      "updated": 1786319079049,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) How can we scale to support 10k clicks per second?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) How can we scale to support 10k clicks per second?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GhHd75gQAJFDXevEIJULG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1944.194601433886,
      "y": 547.1238192003312,
      "width": 461.71966552734375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1925537329,
      "version": 127,
      "versionNonce": 740828447,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786319127033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Both Kinesis and Flink partition by AdId with\ncelerity solution for hot shards\n- 7-day retention period on Kinesis's",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Both Kinesis and Flink partition by AdId with\ncelerity solution for hot shards\n- 7-day retention period on Kinesis's",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a-YL8bVfsmzCfHGHQ1tee",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1623.559171853839,
      "y": 85.21832411224352,
      "width": 344.51971435546875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 232153105,
      "version": 80,
      "versionNonce": 1797145649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786319151183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- generate ad impression id as \nidempotency key and store in cache",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- generate ad impression id as \nidempotency key and store in cache",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1dn250Ur45G9p2ctaWles",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2249.322813938985,
      "y": -3.769912377020745,
      "width": 144.0998992919922,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b80",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1281604543,
      "version": 152,
      "versionNonce": 798281439,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786319173059,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Advertisement:\n- AdId\n- RedirectURL\n- {metadata}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Advertisement:\n- AdId\n- RedirectURL\n- {metadata}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wAjPXjJIUXYEqroSLnuU0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1256.89192317567,
      "y": 1367.7600424324314,
      "width": 960.9793701171875,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b81",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1830561599,
      "version": 1070,
      "versionNonce": 1815054769,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786319778864,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Click Processor Service: can easily scale horizontally by adding more isnatce.\nWe have load balancer in front tof this service to distribute load across instances\n- Stream (Kafka/Kinesis) - Sharding by AdId, stream processor can read from\nmultiple shards in parallel. \n- Flink: Seperated flink job reading from each shard, doing aggregation for AdIds\n- OLAP database (Snowflake, Bigquery) handle scaling automatically.\nClickhouse -- can shard by AdverstiserId, so all data for given advertiser live on same node,\nmaking queries for advertiser faster\n- Handle HOT SHARD:\n--- Further partitioning the data. (eg: partition by appending random key, only do for popular Ads)\n--- when writing to OLAP, FLink strip the suffic (eg: AdId:0-N) and only take AdId as Key,\ndo SUM aggregation so concurrent write from different partition should work correctly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Click Processor Service: can easily scale horizontally by adding more isnatce.\nWe have load balancer in front tof this service to distribute load across instances\n- Stream (Kafka/Kinesis) - Sharding by AdId, stream processor can read from\nmultiple shards in parallel. \n- Flink: Seperated flink job reading from each shard, doing aggregation for AdIds\n- OLAP database (Snowflake, Bigquery) handle scaling automatically.\nClickhouse -- can shard by AdverstiserId, so all data for given advertiser live on same node,\nmaking queries for advertiser faster\n- Handle HOT SHARD:\n--- Further partitioning the data. (eg: partition by appending random key, only do for popular Ads)\n--- when writing to OLAP, FLink strip the suffic (eg: AdId:0-N) and only take AdId as Key,\ndo SUM aggregation so concurrent write from different partition should work correctly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
